    {
      "body": "EVIDENCE. The advance screen offers \"Today\" or \"Super fast\" receipt options with express-fee language after the user has subscribed and applied for the advance.\nLEGAL REASONING. The complaint alleges Cleo advertised instant or same-day cash but disclosed only later that same-day or next-day receipt required an extra fee and might still take longer.\nSTATED LAW. FTC Act Section 5(a), 15 U.S.C. 45(a).",
